WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:04.409
Travelers across India are
searching for their next trip.

2
00:00:04.409 --> 00:00:07.550
Is your travel business
where they are looking?

3
00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:12.932
MyTravelTown is India's first
AI-powered travel marketplace,

4
00:00:12.932 --> 00:00:18.850
connecting travelers with verified
travel partners and curated packages.

5
00:00:19.300 --> 00:00:25.929
Showcase unlimited domestic and international
packages, connect directly with travelers,

6
00:00:25.929 --> 00:00:30.600
and generate quality leads. All
with zero booking commissions.

7
00:00:31.300 --> 00:00:36.000
Getting started takes four simple
steps, right on our website.

8
00:00:36.450 --> 00:00:40.892
Step one: create your profile. On
the Become a Partner page,

9
00:00:40.892 --> 00:00:43.482
click Register as a Travel Partner,

10
00:00:43.482 --> 00:00:47.850
and log in with your mobile number
and a one-time password.

11
00:00:48.300 --> 00:00:55.293
Add your photo, your company and its
registration document, a short bio, your location,

12
00:00:55.293 --> 00:00:56.900
and your experience.

13
00:00:57.350 --> 00:01:03.975
Pick the trips you specialise in, then verify
your identity instantly with DigiLocker.

14
00:01:04.425 --> 00:01:10.675
Submit your registration, and our team
reviews your profile before activating it.

15
00:01:11.375 --> 00:01:16.510
Step two: list your packages. Add
photos, destinations, pricing,

16
00:01:16.510 --> 00:01:19.800
and a day-by-day itinerary, then publish.

17
00:01:20.250 --> 00:01:25.900
Step three: get discovered, as travelers
browse and compare your packages.

18
00:01:26.350 --> 00:01:32.116
Step four: receive inquiries. Travelers view
your package and your partner profile,

19
00:01:32.116 --> 00:01:34.200
and connect with you directly.

20
00:01:34.900 --> 00:01:41.425
Grow your travel business with MyTravelTown.
Register as a travel partner today.
